      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To efficiently resolve this without incurring dispute costs, offer a partial refund or a significant store credit alongside a sincere apology for the damaged item. This acknowledges the customer's frustration while mitigating the risk of a formal claim against you. You can then politely explain that the transit data suggests the damage may not be covered by the carrier at this moment. This approach prioritizes customer retention while limiting your financial exposure.",
