      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are correct; directly citing the sensor logs risks escalating the situation and alienating the customer. To maximize efficiency and CSAT, immediately processing a free replacement or full refund is often the quickest path to resolution. This de-escalates the conflict instantly by prioritizing goodwill over fault determination. While it costs slightly more upfront, avoiding a formal dispute saves significant future labor and administrative fees.",
